TIP:  The intro starts with a sharp downstroke of |G| followed by four rapid strokes down/up/down/up of |G|.  Same pattern with |D|.  Then the strumming pattern which permeates the song takes hold and it’s kind of important.  It goes down, down/up <very brief pause>, up/down/up and then the pattern repeats with the chord change being on the downstroke.
  

